    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一、行列式的概念",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            329,
            129,
            504,
            147
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "行列式是一个数，它是不同行不同列元素乘积的代数和.",
        "bbox": [
            327,
            165,
            803,
            183
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例如，大家所熟悉的三阶行列式",
        "bbox": [
            327,
            189,
            601,
            205
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/3109854cba685bc46c27906ee7e7ff59aa6ffd7f116fdf3369ddeb60d7e72111.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{vmatrix} a_{1} & a_{2} & a_{3} \\\\ b_{1} & b_{2} & b_{3} \\\\ c_{1} & c_{2} & c_{3} \\end{vmatrix} = a_{1}b_{2}c_{3} + a_{2}b_{3}c_{1} + a_{3}b_{1}c_{2} - a_{3}b_{2}c_{1} - a_{2}b_{1}c_{3} - a_{1}b_{3}c_{2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            294,
            212,
            867,
            279
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "其每一项都是3个数的乘积，从字母看a，b，c各有1个，说明这3个数一个在第1行，一个在第2行，一个在第3行；而从下标看数字1,2，3各有1个，说明这3个数分别来自第1列、第2列和第3列.",
        "bbox": [
            287,
            285,
            872,
            351
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "在这6项中，有3项带“+”号，3项带“”号，大家可以用对角线方法来记忆：",
        "bbox": [
            287,
            356,
            870,
            397
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/7e42e92f66c139ff2e6f2a4e6ea264e6d3c59fde180244a449d55e257cacbd61.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            324,
            401,
            826,
            541
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "当三阶行列式的元素中有较多的 $ \\text{\" }0 \"$ 时，用对角线法来计算行列式的值是简便的.例如，",
        "bbox": [
            289,
            549,
            870,
            589
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/3fbdad3cd9c87e2104fc51e97e79278c6997ea1eb161f1555099915ac5583e3c.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left| \\begin{matrix}0 & 1 & 2 \\\\3 & 0 & 4 \\\\5 & 6 & 0\\end{matrix} \\right|&= 0 \\times 0 \\times 0 + 1 \\times 4 \\times 5 + 2 \\times 3 \\times 6 - 2 \\times 0 \\times 5 - 1 \\times 3 \\times 6 \\\\&= 0 - 0 \\times 4 \\times 6 = 56,\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            332,
            594,
            872,
            682
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/b2eab612bae2c2d0ab08c544f94dddb9747e9d54ec79b72a857901c198fdaf00.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned} &\\begin{vmatrix}\\\\ &1 & 0 & - 1 \\\\&2 & - 2 & 1 \\\\&0 & - 3 & 4\\\\ &\\end{vmatrix}=-8+0+6-0-0-(-3)=1.\\\\ \\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            332,
            689,
            773,
            755
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一般地，我们应当用行列式的性质将其恒等变形化简，再通过展开公式（用降阶法）来计算行列式的值.",
        "bbox": [
            289,
            759,
            870,
            801
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对于n阶行列式的概念，大家要有一个简单的了解.",
        "bbox": [
            327,
            807,
            766,
            825
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
